# Resolution input for the blocked private BS-RoFormer v1.0.12 challenger.
#
# This is not an installer or a product dependency. It contains only packages
# needed by a future bounded adapter around the exact `attend.py` and
# `bs_roformer.py` model modules at ZFTurbo source revision
# aef04b2e52fb3beaf25e333199f5a7236e628e7b. The adapter must load those two
# files through an isolated synthetic package so Python does not execute the
# upstream `models/bs_roformer/__init__.py`: that initializer also imports the
# unrelated MelBand model and would otherwise introduce librosa and its broad
# audio-analysis dependency tree. Canonical PCM WAV I/O belongs to the bounded
# adapter and must use Python's standard library rather than the optional
# SoundFile wheel and its bundled LGPL media libraries.
# Training, GUI, experiment tracking, the broad upstream inference utility,
# other architectures and optional metric packages are intentionally excluded.
# The generated lock remains unapproved and must not be installed until the
# checkpoint identity/terms, static inspection and worker blockers are closed.

